comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-05T05:42:03.512Z",codex-sol,"All-source coverage passes across 9 source files including every script, with 100% statements, branches, functions and lines and no coverage exemptions. The docstring gate checks all 131 function/export declarations, including callbacks and short helpers. Local npm and Bun packed imports and local-directory pm installation passed, followed by real tev1 triage through npx and bunx and negative gate JSON/exit 1. CI/CodeQL/dependency/release workflows are present; no remote CI run or publication occurred. Follow-ups pm-jev-5h61 and pm-jev-2rp1 record the development-checkout scan cap and development-only audit findings."
  "2026-10-05T05:51:02.994Z",codex-sol,"The linked-test runner exposed a fixture boundary bug: resolvePmRoot honored inherited PM_PATH and routed temporary-project SDK operations into the linked schema sandbox. Fixtures now use the SDK resolveImplicitPmRoot workspace resolver, preserving explicit fresh tracker roots without hardcoded storage paths. A regression test verifies synthetic IDs and one-item isolation under an inherited PM_PATH override. Direct package behavior was already passing; linked acceptance is rerunning against truly isolated projects."
  "2026-10-05T05:56:45.743Z",codex-sol,"Final linked coverage passed: 86 tests, 86 passed, zero failed/skipped/canceled, all 9 source files measured at 100% statements/branches/functions/lines. c8 totals: 2531/2531 statements and lines, 481/481 branches, 61/61 functions. Docstrings: all 131 function/export checks documented. The inherited PM_PATH regression is covered. Linked local installation passed npm/Bun imports, npx/bunx live triage, and negative CLI gate JSON with exit 1. Direct release:check passed; production dependency audit is clean. Claims are being released for handoff; no item will be closed."
